18
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:33,160
For centuries, they fulfilled our basic human need for shelter

19
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:37,800
against the elements and to divide the spaces where we live

20
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:38,700
