00:05:15,701 --> 00:05:19,300
cables, and we'll monitor and watch how far this flame

80
00:05:19,301 --> 00:05:27,520
travels as it moves down. The Steiner Tunnel's foot-by-foot

81
00:05:27,521 --> 00:05:31,160
measuring scale and observation windows allow technicians to

82
00:05:31,161 --> 00:05:42,080
to monitor each test. The flames on these cables spread

