112
00:07:44,121 --> 00:07:46,740
and doesn't allow the fire to spread to other parts of the structure.

113
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:51,780
Even glass walls are subjected to the same scorching flames.

114
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:56,560
You can hear the stress as the heat builds inside the wall.

115
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
In this case, it isn't doing so well.

116
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:15,520
Just as UL tests how walls fare against fire,

117
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:19,120
