00:37:43,120 --> 00:37:45,820
But imagine a home in which the walls contain a far more

589
00:37:45,920 --> 00:37:47,320
sophisticated system.

590
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:54,780
The walls of the future will act like eyes, ears, and hands

591
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:57,680
that see, hear, and feel.

