00:38:00,980 --> 00:38:04,780
instructions to a heart that pumps energy where it's needed.

594
00:38:07,420 --> 00:38:12,920
That future has already arrived in Boulder, Colorado, inside the

595
00:38:12,921 --> 00:38:17,420
walls of the Edge House, designed by Rodwin Architecture.

596
00:38:17,421 --> 00:38:21,420
It takes the concept of walls to a whole new level, using them to

597
00:38:21,421 --> 00:38:26,420
provide the holy grail for energy consumers, a home with near net

